        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death on Holly Ridge</strong> is a first person Christmas horror experience where a routine delivery plunges a driver into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Christmas Eve, she arrives at <strong>Holly Ridge Lane</strong> for a scheduled stop. By circumstance she finds her way into a house of death and decay. Soon reality twists and something haunts her through time and space that shouldn’t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nightmare, unravel its disturbing secrets, and survive a night where even the snowstorm outside seems determined to seal your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shifting, reality breaking nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slasher intensity mixed with supernatural dread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Christmas setting soaked in fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and environmental story clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple delivery. A nightmare of death. A night you may never escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 1–1.5 hours depending on playstyle. Designed to be experienced in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD / Arrow Keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Look: Move Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use / Interact: Left Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus: Middle Mouse Wheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighter: L or Tab</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death on Holly Ridge</strong> is a first person Christmas horror experience where a routine delivery plunges a driver into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Christmas Eve, she arrives at <strong>Holly Ridge Lane</strong> for a scheduled stop. By circumstance she finds her way into a house of death and decay. Soon reality twists and something haunts her through time and space that shouldn’t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nightmare, unravel its disturbing secrets, and survive a night where even the snowstorm outside seems determined to seal your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shifting, reality breaking nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slasher intensity mixed with supernatural dread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Christmas setting soaked in fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and environmental story clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple delivery. A nightmare of death. A night you may never escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 1–1.5 hours depending on playstyle. Designed to be experienced in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD / Arrow Keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Look: Move Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use / Interact: Left Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus: Middle Mouse Wheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighter: L or Tab</p>",
